# Sombras (subsistema 04): mañana con sombras largas, mediodía, de cerca (penumbra y acné), noche con luna.
close
tp 170.5 77 166.5
command weather clear
time 1500
look -90 25
sleep 3
screenshot sombras-manana
time 6000
look 0 30
sleep 2
screenshot sombras-mediodia
tp 172.5 70 160.5
time 2500
look 0 50
sleep 2
screenshot sombras-cerca
tp 170.5 77 166.5
time 18000
look 0 30
sleep 2
screenshot sombras-noche
